  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;real matrix such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is a singular matrix",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Taking transpose on both sides we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>aP</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Subtract equation (1) and (2),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>From equation (1),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Taking adjoint on both sides,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Adj</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Adj</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Adj</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Adj</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
